{"accountName": "360威胁情报中心", "author": "360威胁情报中心", "body": null, "content": [{"text": "原创 360威胁情报中心 2026-09-25 08:59 北京", "type": "p"}, {"text": "近期360反勒索团队接到多起Sorry勒索家族新变种反馈，感染规模达数千例且攻击仍在持续，加密数据覆盖数据库、备份、文档和源码，样本分析确认该变种正处于快速活跃期而非偶发事件", "type": "p"}, {"_imgCount": 1, "caption": "", "src": "https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/Emmib7pWXrXLhRwxeL3pdqkFeibXkHuPibYAufn3taRFLzbwbcvzQs5Z6U4cQfMgrKJBfVQ32S8fCVicyswfSAyggmo5GxYjzicdlrbL31zYUZUs/0?wx_fmt=jpeg", "type": "img"}, {"text": "近期360反勒索团队连续接到多起Sorry勒索家族相关反馈，第一波受害用户数据被加密的时间集中在9月20日夜间到21日，感染规模达数千例，且攻击仍在持续，本轮攻击的加密数据类型覆盖数据库、备份文件、办公文档和源码仓库等。结合对样本的编译时间戳信息和近期集中反馈与告警的事件，可以判断该家族变种正处于快速活跃期而非偶发单点事件。", "type": "p"}, {"text": "360反勒索团队结合大量事前未安装360防护的用户反馈及云端攻防数据，完成溯源分析，最终确认本轮Sorry家族投毒的攻击链源自某企业远控软件的漏洞利用。而本次变种样本的扩展名从此前的.sorry变为了.ths，勒索信文件名也变为了“hello.txt”。此外，其加密算法实现也从RSA+AES-GCM，整体调整为X25519+XChaCha20-Poly1305，其他部分则与之前版本保持一致。", "type": "p"}, {"text": "一、样本分析", "type": "p"}, {"_imgCount": 2, "caption": "", "src": "https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Emmib7pWXrXIF2JIQL7YN2sZxsY9n3SyNhP7RjHOWYLc7Xo3ia4FHk495VvXJpDgvjV2BCG49zC0yIeicc8laS8ibtWLKtJXKbNBYic7vJRuBH4M/640?from=appmsg", "type": "img"}, {"text": "本次，我们基于捕获的一个真实样本进行分析。分析用例的具体样本信息如下：", "type": "p"}, {"text": "项目", "type": "p"}, {"text": "数值", "type": "p"}, {"_imgCount": 3, "caption": "", "src": "https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/Emmib7pWXrXLrVicqurRGJFJkMNdV5YNSHfCicySwJj5UgsSDHSvOga3Sic1yiard2kuz8367bJibht9crNwvAdDdMGreBJEJZtFEPpJOXiaWNgvYs/640?from=appmsg", "type": "img"}, {"text": "投毒路径", "type": "p"}, {"text": "C:\\Users\\Public\\dbg.exe", "type": "p"}, {"text": "MD5", "type": "p"}, {"_imgCount": true, "caption": "", "src": "https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/Emmib7pWXrXLcIsgVoUgmpOJdfNcibdibt4GEQAT5v8bIfZeOliakbVJg5wA5VQtFweIxX2NiaXqw9kufeYH1cQHKlCysOicZrXojcicPe5toMdKyg/640?from=appmsg", "type": "img"}, {"text": "819e0d56c53a294befbb5ff879ec8886", "type": "p"}, {"text": "SHA1", "type": "p"}, {"text": "47219f67d14f806efa039d63cff179128b1996cd", "type": "p"}, {"_imgCount": true, "caption": "", "src": "https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/Emmib7pWXrXKagYgBIn1eLU7TEibzxicxt2uVKTNiaKwfHaqDwQ6toudaRFqBwa1WqKUiak5Hedv44mSP5XfibjnKFbrFdtwgjj10gJQeq9kib4mh4/640?from=appmsg", "type": "img"}, {"text": "SHA256", "type": "p"}, {"text": "4e93fb51de8f05622b5edff8c6cec9cc8660049157c88ad4f53572e7d4d16c55", "type": "p"}, {"text": "大小", "type": "p"}, {"text": "72704 Byte", "type": "p"}, {"text": "1. 基本信息", "type": "p"}, {"text": "该样本并没有进行过多伪装，程序本身没有图标，并且也没有任何数字签名信息。但在文件信息层面，该样本依然进行了一定程度的伪装——其自称是微软公司开发的图片代理服务程序（Photos Agent Service）。", "type": "p"}, {"text": "2. 执行准备", "type": "p"}, {"text": "样本执行后，会先检查当前设备的网络情况，之后再获取当前设备的计算机名、用户名、IP地址、处理器数量等基本信息，并判断当前环境是不是真实环境（非分析测试环境）。", "type": "p"}, {"text": "完成环境判断后，会尝试停止当前设备正在运行的数据库进程，以方便后续对数据库文件的加密操作。", "type": "p"}, {"text": "此外，该勒索软件还会创建互斥量以防止重复运行。", "type": "p"}, {"text": "3. 加密数据", "type": "p"}, {"text": "与此前的Sorry家族不同，本次捕获的样本更新了用于加密数据的算法实现方案。样本会在本地进行密钥的初始化生成，其中用于加密各类信息的非对称加密算法采用了 X25519算法。", "type": "p"}, {"text": "而用于快速加密各类文件的对称加密算法，则采用了XChaCha20-Poly1305算法实现。", "type": "p"}, {"text": "在完成各类密钥的初始化操作后，勒索软件会遍历当前设备的磁盘，进行数据加密操作。", "type": "p"}, {"text": "本次用于分析的样本在具体执行加密操作时，对设备的数据文件共进行了三轮扫描，并根据文件类型分批次进行加密。", "type": "p"}, {"text": "其中，第一轮加密的文件扩展名均为各类常见的数据库文件（共28个扩展名），可见作者对数据库的重视程度。", "type": "p"}, {"text": ".db", "type": "p"}, {"text": ".adf", "type": "p"}, {"text": ".dbb", "type": "p"}, {"text": ".db3", "type": "p"}, {"text": ".db_journal", "type": "p"}, {"text": ".dbf", "type": "p"}, {"text": ".dbx", "type": "p"}, {"text": ".fdb", "type": "p"}, {"text": ".mdb", "type": "p"}, {"text": ".mdf", "type": "p"}, {"text": ".ndf", "type": "p"}, {"text": ".sql", "type": "p"}, {"text": ".sqlite", "type": "p"}, {"text": ".sqlite3", "type": "p"}, {"text": ".sqlitedb", "type": "p"}, {"text": ".ldf", "type": "p"}, {"text": ".sdf", "type": "p"}, {"text": ".3db", "type": "p"}, {"text": ".accdb", "type": "p"}, {"text": ".accde", "type": "p"}, {"text": ".accdr", "type": "p"}, {"text": ".accdt", "type": "p"}, {"text": ".bak", "type": "p"}, {"text": ".bdb", "type": "p"}, {"text": ".edb", "type": "p"}, {"text": ".dmp", "type": "p"}, {"text": ".weax", "type": "p"}, {"text": ".rox", "type": "p"}, {"text": "而第二轮扫描中，勒索软件的目标则转变为常见的文档及影音类文件（共59个扩展名）。", "type": "p"}, {"text": ".doc", "type": "p"}, {"text": ".docx", "type": "p"}, {"text": ".docb", "type": "p"}, {"text": ".docm", "type": "p"}, {"text": ".dot", "type": "p"}, {"text": ".dotm", "type": "p"}, {"text": ".dotx", "type": "p"}, {"text": ".pdf", "type": "p"}, {"text": ".txt", "type": "p"}, {"text": ".rtf", "type": "p"}, {"text": ".odt", "type": "p"}, {"text": ".ods", "type": "p"}, {"text": ".odp", "type": "p"}, {"text": ".ott", "type": "p"}, {"text": ".xls", "type": "p"}, {"text": ".xlsx", "type": "p"}, {"text": ".xlsb", "type": "p"}, {"text": ".xlsm", "type": "p"}, {"text": ".xlt", "type": "p"}, {"text": ".xltm", "type": "p"}, {"text": ".xltx", "type": "p"}, {"text": ".ppt", "type": "p"}, {"text": ".pptm", "type": "p"}, {"text": ".pptx", "type": "p"}, {"text": ".pot", "type": "p"}, {"text": ".potm", "type": "p"}, {"text": ".potx", "type": "p"}, {"text": ".pps", "type": "p"}, {"text": ".ppsm", "type": "p"}, {"text": ".ppsx", "type": "p"}, {"text": ".ppam", "type": "p"}, {"text": ".psd", "type": "p"}, {"text": ".ai", "type": "p"}, {"text": ".eps", "type": "p"}, {"text": ".svg", "type": "p"}, {"text": ".png", "type": "p"}, {"text": ".jpg", "type": "p"}, {"text": ".jpeg", "type": "p"}, {"text": ".gif", "type": "p"}, {"text": ".bmp", "type": "p"}, {"text": ".tiff", "type": "p"}, {"text": ".tif", "type": "p"}, {"text": ".ico", "type": "p"}, {"text": ".raw", "type": "p"}, {"text": ".cr2", "type": "p"}, {"text": ".nef", "type": "p"}, {"text": ".orf", "type": "p"}, {"text": ".dng", "type": "p"}, {"text": ".raf", "type": "p"}, {"text": ".arw", "type": "p"}, {"text": ".webp", "type": "p"}, {"text": ".fpx", "type": "p"}, {"text": ".dwg", "type": "p"}, {"text": ".dxf", "type": "p"}, {"text": ".skp", "type": "p"}, {"text": ".indd", "type": "p"}, {"text": ".livp", "type": "p"}, {"text": ".heic", "type": "p"}, {"text": ".heif", "type": "p"}, {"text": "最后的第三轮扫描则为收尾工作，将其他类型的有价值文件类型全都覆盖了进去（共357个扩展名），扩展名数量非常庞大。", "type": "p"}, {"text": ".1cd", "type": "p"}, {"text": ".3dm", "type": "p"}, {"text": ".3ds", "type": "p"}, {"text": ".3fr", "type": "p"}, {"text": ".3g2", "type": "p"}, {"text": ".3gp", "type": "p"}, {"text": ".3pr", "type": "p"}, {"text": ".602", "type": "p"}, {"text": ".7z", "type": "p"}, {"text": ".ps1", "type": "p"}, {"text": ".7zip", "type": "p"}, {"text": ".aac", "type": "p"}, {"text": ".ab4", "type": "p"}, {"text": ".ach", "type": "p"}, {"text": ".acr", "type": "p"}, {"text": ".act", "type": "p"}, {"text": ".adb", "type": "p"}, {"text": ".adp", "type": "p"}, {"text": ".ads", "type": "p"}, {"text": ".aes", "type": "p"}, {"text": ".agdl", "type": "p"}, {"text": ".aiff", "type": "p"}, {"text": ".ait", "type": "p"}, {"text": ".al", "type": "p"}, {"text": ".aoi", "type": "p"}, {"text": ".apj", "type": "p"}, {"text": ".arc", "type": "p"}, {"text": ".asc", "type": "p"}, {"text": ".asf", "type": "p"}, {"text": ".asm", "type": "p"}, {"text": ".asp", "type": "p"}, {"text": ".aspx", "type": "p"}, {"text": ".asx", "type": "p"}, {"text": ".avi", "type": "p"}, {"text": ".awg", "type": "p"}, {"text": ".back", "type": "p"}, {"text": ".backup", "type": "p"}, {"text": ".backupdb", "type": "p"}, {"text": ".bank", "type": "p"}, {"text": ".bat", "type": "p"}, {"text": ".bay", "type": "p"}, {"text": ".bgt", "type": "p"}, {"text": ".bik", "type": "p"}, {"text": ".bin", "type": "p"}, {"text": ".bkp", "type": "p"}, {"text": ".blend", "type": "p"}, {"text": ".bpw", "type": "p"}, {"text": ".brd", "type": "p"}, {"text": ".c", "type": "p"}, {"text": ".cdf", "type": "p"}, {"text": ".cdr", "type": "p"}, {"text": ".cdr3", "type": "p"}, {"text": ".cdr4", "type": "p"}, {"text": ".cdr5", "type": "p"}, {"text": ".cdr6", "type": "p"}, {"text": ".cdrw", "type": "p"}, {"text": ".cdx", "type": "p"}, {"text": ".ce1", "type": "p"}, {"text": ".ce2", "type": "p"}, {